# clang-tidy is intentionally disabled for this repo.
#
# The previous broad profile made even small-looking translation units
# prohibitively slow because umbrella headers pull in Eigen, Arrow/Parquet,
# spdlog, SIMD, containers, concurrency, and stats. Verification rests on
# exactly two legs that exist: build warnings (/W4 /permissive- /WX, ATX_WERROR
# ON) and tests (ctest). No sanitizer build is configured in this repo and
# clang-format is not run either — do not cite either as a gate. See
# .agents/cpp/agent.md section 8.
---
Checks: '-*'
WarningsAsErrors: ''
